# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — OHOS native SDK 探测须兼容「平铺」与「llvm 嵌套」两种布局：本地绿 ≠ CI 绿 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-10-11
# Software: apt-pkg 2.7.14
# Gate: HarmonyOS PC conan create（generate() 阶段）
# Status: DRAFT — 需人工/AI 审核后 promote 为 E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. 审核 error_excerpt 与实际验证
#   2. 改名为 E0XX.kv 并移动到 knowledge/graph/
